{"symbol":"ODL.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:55:07Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Eng. Wladyslawa Rogowskiego 22","city":"Starachowice","zip":"27-200","country":"Poland","phone":"48 41 275 8600","fax":"48 41 275 8681","website":"https://odlewniepolskie.pl","industry":"Metal Fabrication","industryKey":"metal-fabrication","industryDisp":"Metal Fabrication","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Odlewnie Polskie S.A. produces and sells ferrous alloy castings in Germany, the Czech Republic, the Netherlands, the United States, Sweden, Hungary, Austria, Slovakia, Denmark, Turkey, Spain, Italy, Switzerland, France, Serbia, and the United Kingdom. The company offers ductile iron products using gray, nodular, austempered ductile iron, SiMo, and steel cast iron materials. It also offers HWS molding line for medium- and high-volume production of iron castings; buys and sells foreign castings; and provides services in German foundries. In addition, it provides customer services, including design, production of foundry equipment, creation of castings, and their machining and heat treatment, as well as priming, assembly, and shipment services. The company offers its products to machinery, industrial fittings, railways, automotive, agricultural, construction and other machinery, energy, and mining industries. Odlewnie Polskie S.A. was founded in 1899 and is headquartered in Starachowice, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":548,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Leszek  Walczyk","age":66,"title":"President of the Management Board & Chief Executive","yearBorn":1959,"fiscalYear":2023,"totalPay":1602836,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Ewa Beata Majkowska","title":"Secretary of the Supervisory Board","fiscalYear":2023,"totalPay":103122,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Henryk  Schmalenberg","title":"Marketing Director","fiscalYear":2023,"exercisedValue"